# CLASSIC ERA FLAVOR (S43). Same engine, classic data: game data loads from
# data\generated_classic\ (built by `pipeline/generate.py --flavor classic` from the
# 1.15.x client via wago.tools, classic bp+die magnitude semantics). Forever-only data is
# DELIBERATELY not loaded: forever_talents.lua (an empty-but-truthy table would defeat
# TB.talents()'s classic fallback), tf_talents.lua (Forever per-rank text, wrong here),
# verified_rules.lua (rank rules verified ON Forever, not here - classic starts presumed
# + own-scan). crowd_schema.lua and peer_baselines.lua are flavor-independent and shared.

